      "text": "We were heading out from the airport & found this place.They have a tea and snacks counter and a restaurant attached that serves meals. They had a large choice of items for breakfast,from the usual idli,dosa to appams and idiyappam. We were 2 of us so ordered 3 appams each ,half a bowl of veg stew & a full egg roast ,it was really delicious,we kept getting appams straight from the pan. Service was very courteous. They had very clean restroom too.",
