      "text": "I am giving stars purely on the basis of rest stop that we took to change our baby's diaper on the way. Since this was rated as a good restaurant, we assumed washroom would be good. But alas! washroom didn't have water! After using washroom when we headed for the basin, there was no water! Very weird for a family place! We had thought of eating as well something here but then decided not to. Again, since we didn't have food, cant comment on that but a dining place on the highway is supposed to have water in the washroom. Basic requirement!",
